{"key": "eval12:eval12@01cfbb1e713f-d52cbe42aa|open", "final": "WITH g AS (SELECT ordersmark, COUNT(*) AS cnt FROM orderexecutions GROUP BY ordersmark), t AS (SELECT SUM(cnt) AS total, COUNT(*) AS n FROM g) SELECT g.ordersmark AS order_reference, g.cnt AS execution_count, g.cnt * 1.0 / t.total AS share, g.cnt * 1.0 / t.total - 1.0 / t.n AS share_minus_avg FROM g, t ORDER BY share_minus_avg DESC NULLS LAST LIMIT 10", "turns": 1, "batch_size": 1, "model": "sonnet", "executes": true, "answer": [["OB102450                            ", 2, 0.002, 0.000998998998998999], ["OB100239                            ", 1, 0.001, -1.0010010010009715e-06], ["OB101796                            ", 1, 0.001, -1.0010010010009715e-06], ["OB102755                            ", 1, 0.001, -1.0010010010009715e-06], ["OB102886                            ", 1, 0.001, -1.0010010010009715e-06], ["OB103837                            ", 1, 0.001, -1.0010010010009715e-06], ["OB104042                            ", 1, 0.001, -1.0010010010009715e-06], ["OB104465                            ", 1, 0.001, -1.0010010010009715e-06], ["OB108316                            ", 1, 0.001, -1.0010010010009715e-06], ["OB108470                            ", 1, 0.001, -1.0010010010009715e-06]], "rows_answer": 10}